@startuml
title RuleSphere - Activity Diagram\n02. Author, Validate and Sandbox | UC-05..09
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF5FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #496477
|Decision Author|
start
:Create or open a Decision draft;
|Control Plane|
:Authorize author within Workspace;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return access error;
  stop
endif
if (Selected version is frozen?) then (yes)
  :Create a new mutable draft;
endif
|Decision Author|
:Edit nodes, dependencies, schema versions,\nsensitivity metadata and library pins;
|Control Plane|
:Check scope and save draft revision;
|Decision Author|
:Request validation;
|Control Plane|
:Recheck authorization and load exact revision;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return access error;
  stop
endif
:Check DAG, reference scope, contracts\nand schema compatibility;
:Return validity, issues and breaking-change status;
if (Required validation passed?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Keep draft non-publishable; report issues;
  note right
Author may edit and validate again in a later request.
Breaking changes contribute to risk; they are not
automatically invalid under every compatibility policy.
end note
  stop
endif
|Decision Author|
if (Run optional sandbox?) then (yes)
  :Provide test input and request sandbox run;
  |Control Plane|
  :Recheck permission, current revision\nand test input contract;
  if (Authorized and executable?) then (yes)
    |Sandbox|
    :Execute fixed draft snapshot using DAG semantics;
    :Produce result / attributable error\nand protected execution trace;
    note right
Node execution semantics: diagram 06.
No effect on production traffic or deployment.
end note
    |Decision Author|
    :Inspect simulation outcome;
  else (no)
    |Control Plane|
    :Return access / validation errors;
  endif
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
